                            "sha":  "b5eb5e0bfd1270eba92fa9cb7470921b4517b89c",
                            "time":  "2026-10-14T18:18:24Z",
                            "message":  "[ci skip] Add manual dispatch trigger\n\nWhen a build is partially published (i.e. to Fill but not to Maven), a retry of the same build may reject indefinitely. A manual trigger allows resolving this without an empty commit.\n\nIn an observed case, Fill successfully published but returned a 504. This specific case could probably be handled with idempotent publish and/or improved error handling policies in fill-gradle. Manual trigger is useful regardless to cover any other cases.\n"
                        }
                    ],
